"<i>'gst-register'</i> afterwards.</p><p>For further assistance consult the "
"GStreamer manual, and join #gstreamer on irc.freenode.net.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>A GStreamer fáltalle un rexistro.</h3><p>Asegúrese de ter instalados "
